[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_WHISPER]
Whispers

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_WHISPER_desc]
Hope, just like her name, is something she will never give up. She still believes that Sombra is definitely not the incarnation of terror he claims to be. She believes that even Sombra, the descendant of the Umbrums, is just like an ordinary crystal pony, with his own joys and sorrows, and his own hopes in his heart.\nAt least, she knows he values her, she knows he needs her, she knows he will do everything for her. And all this, perhaps, is the greatest hope she can give him.

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_WHISPER_TOOLTIP]
Complete at least 18 national focuses ([?C15.VAR_C15_SOMBRA_COMPLETED_FOCUSES|Y0]/18).

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_WHISPER]
耳语

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_WHISPER_desc]
希望，正如她的名字一样，是她永远不会放弃的东西。她依然相信着，森布拉绝对不是那个他宣称他所是的那个恐惧的化身。她相信即使是影魔后裔的森布拉，也与一只普通水晶小马一样，有着自己的喜怒哀乐，有着自己心中的希望。\n至少，她知道他重视她，她知道他需要她，她知道他会为了她而做出一切。而这一切，也许就是她所能给予他的最大的希望。

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_WHISPER_TOOLTIP]
完成至少18个国策 ([?C15.VAR_C15_SOMBRA_COMPLETED_FOCUSES|Y0]/18)。

